<title>NEW ZEALAND: Radio Network renews application to NZCC.</title>
<headline>Radio Network renews application to NZCC.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commerce Commission said on Tuesday it had received a fresh application from Radio Network of New Zealand Ltd to buy all the shares of and radio licences held by C93FM (Christchurch) Ltd.</p>
<p>In March the anti-monopolies commission declined Radio Network permission to buy.</p>
